# Direct runtime dependencies only. The lockfile (every transitive package
# pinned + sha256-hashed) is generated for the CONTAINER's platform — Linux,
# Python 3.12 — not for the Mac it is generated on:
#   uv pip compile requirements.in --generate-hashes \
#     --python-version 3.12 --python-platform linux -o requirements.txt
#
# uvicorn WITHOUT [standard]: the extras (uvloop, httptools, watchfiles,
# websockets...) are not needed here — every package left out is one less
# thing to patch.
